{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15d0_level_act15d0_04_beg","groupId":"act15d0","stageId":"act15d0_04","title":"勇敢，莽撞","storyCode":"MB-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"d9a604903faa823b32fabbb188cd3f540aa8f7109618137dd392c7adbab2f170","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"赫默，你沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼過來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你在這邊待了很久，就過來看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，你身邊的酒瓶......難道你喝酒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"就一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"繆爾賽思主任呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"她還在那邊等我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"你和她說到哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"說到安東尼希望卡夫卡幫助他，她還和我說了一些有關總轄和塞雷婭的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"要我說給你聽嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"不，暫時不用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像很難過的樣子，剛才繆爾賽思主任對你說了什麼不好的東西嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"不是......雖然也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"我......說不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在思維有些混亂，我有些後悔，感覺自己或許做了一些自己不擅長的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指做這件事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......我應該向你道歉，梅爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"我不該把你捲進來的，是我太膽小了，才忍不住把這件事告訴你，讓你和我一起承擔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"誒，我是沒什麼關係的啦。能被赫默你信任我還蠻開心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"而且反正我實際做的事也就是陪你回哥倫比亞轉了一圈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......其實，有一件事我一直沒有告訴你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事的背後，海德兄弟的背後，是能量科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"誒？是能量科嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你們工程科和能量科關係很緊密，所以我一直不知道該怎麼告訴你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......嗯，其實也還好啦，我們科雖然事務上和能量科確實關係相當緊密，不過我其實也沒有多喜歡能量科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"不如說我還挺怕能量科主任那個人的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"能量科的主任，是個什麼樣的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，雖然我也沒見過幾次啦，不過他有時候會來我們這邊看看，也會旁聽我們的會議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然他一說話就能感覺到是個很厲害很聰明的人，不過感覺有些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道該怎麼說，就是他更在乎我們的東西能用來做什麼，能換來什麼之類的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，塞雷婭引咎辭職後，我們科和能量科感覺聯繫也更加密切了起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"有的時候會有一些奇怪的工作安排下來，我都做不了自己的事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"所以就找了個機會外派來羅德島了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然可露希爾也是個怪人，不過在羅德島工作還蠻開心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"總之你不用太在意啦，赫默。而且，我感覺你做了一件好事，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"好事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你提供的這些情報和分析非常有價值，讓我不得不重視你的意見，赫默幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但首先，這些情報的來源明顯是萊茵生命內部。擅自將內部情報洩露給他人的人，恕我無法信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，從你的日常表現來看，我也相信你並非如此不謹慎的人，所以我需要一個解釋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"這些是我用個人管道搜集並分析得出的情報，和萊茵生命沒有直接的關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但既然你發現了這樣的事，應當交由你們內部處理，羅德島絕無法成為這件事的仲裁者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，我並不期望羅德島能成為仲裁者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想要幫助這個人，想要請教你的意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼是我？或者說，為什麼是羅德島？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的我，比起萊茵生命，更相信羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你懷疑萊茵生命的什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道，我甚至不知道我在懷疑什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"但我來到這裡工作也有很長一段時間了，我親眼看到了羅德島在做的事，我至少知道羅德島在做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"所見未必即所得，赫默幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，或許你沒有發現，不過從你的情報來看，這名叫安東尼的菲林很有可能是經他父親安排才在跨州後立刻被捕的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這很可能是他們早就布下的局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"但安東尼直到今天都沒有出獄，他已經在那座監獄待了六年，而且可能永遠也出不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼要執著於這樣一個與你無關的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我想要認清，我一直服務的萊茵生命，究竟是一家怎樣的公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你可能會失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"但這也好過一無所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......很有說服力，赫默幹員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島不可能在檯面上為你提供任何援助，但我可以站在個人立場給你提供一些意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你能自始至終貫徹你的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"認為自己在做一件好事的想法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在有些開始懷疑，這真的是一件好事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"誒，為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"我開始有些怕了，梅爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"怕什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"一直以來，我總是以為，所有的問題只要我付出努力，就總能被解答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"但這次，我害怕我撞上了我無法解答的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"因為解不開嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"不是解不開，而是我不敢解開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"梅爾，卡夫卡有沒有對你說過，我和她是怎麼認識的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你忘了嗎？她在回憶與米娜的對話時有提到過哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"米娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，終於找到一個和你說話的機會。成果怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"按照你說的，我這段時間一直在悄悄摸清這座監獄的構造，現在已經基本上搞清楚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"這座監獄的獄卒雖然挺鬆懈的，但是構造真的很嚴密，我感覺要出去挺困難的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事沒事，總會有辦法的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"比起這個，你那邊呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"我和安東尼搭上線了，他原本就有出去的想法，所以應該按照PLAN-A行動，我們協助他越獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來我們會把醫務室當做秘密基地，我和那邊的杜瑪醫生說過你了，你直接去就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，明明都要見到你心心念念的大個子了，怎麼這麼洩氣的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，我遠遠地看過他幾次，感覺大個子和以前救我一家的時候差了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎，他以前是什麼樣的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"以前的他，要更加，嗯......帥一點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼形容啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"自從我知道是他救了我家之後，我偷偷去看過他一次，那個時候的他比現在要開朗好多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"啥樣啊，是不是那種出手很闊綽，身後跟十幾個保鏢的闊少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"不是不是......嗯......好像又有一點，我也不知道怎麼形容......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是闊少啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"反正現在的他，感覺很沉默，總是沒有表情，我看了感覺有些難過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟在這裡被關了六年呢，再開朗的人也會變成那樣吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"說的也是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我們只要幫助他逃出去，他肯定就會變成原來的樣子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"大概吧，誒，其實我覺得變成闊少也不好吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧行吧，我是不懂你啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"要這麼說的話，我才不懂你，你說你是受朋友委託才來幫安東尼的，為什麼你要幫你那個叫赫默的朋友到這個地步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"......因為我覺得赫默是一個好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼理由？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我和赫默是在一次她出外勤的時候認識的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"我嘛，習慣了用一些不怎麼光彩的手段做事，正好被她撞上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然當時事情鬧得其實還不小，我還被她害得差點斷了那筆生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"不過結果還算好，而且也算是和她認識了，不是有句話叫不打不相識嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之後，經常會給我介紹一些工作，感覺是希望我能夠像她那樣正經做事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來是個很好的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"是很好啦，不過我總覺得赫默把這片大地想得太美好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"其實很多事是沒有辦法像她所想的那樣進展的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"不過赫默雖然有點幼稚，但很聰明，也不固執，所以我一直覺得她這樣就好，也願意和她交朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"我雖然朋友也有不少，不過像赫默這樣的只有這一個，我很珍惜她的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你才會為了幫她進入監獄嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那倒不全是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"一個是我以前就聽說過這座監獄，確實對這裡有些好奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"另一個嘛，是赫默這次有些不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說讓你幫別人越獄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。還有拜託我幫她收集一些企業的情報，以過去赫默的性格，我很難想像她會做這樣的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......是她身上發生了什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道......自從她離開哥倫比亞去了一家叫羅德島的公司後，我就沒有再和她見過面了，只有書信聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"她對離開哥倫比亞的原因也沒有明說......不過，應該是發生了什麼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"反正，赫默這次感覺很堅定的樣子，所以我也打算好好幫她一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"......卡夫卡，難道說，你其實是個很好的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，難道在你眼裡我是個壞人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得你是怎麼威逼利誘騙我和你一起進入監獄的哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，一下子突然對陌生人說請你和我一起進監獄吧，不管怎麼樣都會被覺得腦子有問題的吧，所以我肯定要採取一些方法啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我說不過你，算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻嘻，不過，反正我覺得這不能用好不好來算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"就好像你為了曾經救過你一家的安東尼鋌而走險，但你做的事卻是幫他越獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"如果說為了朋友付出就一定是善良的，那其實我朋友裡的好人說不定比那些體面人還要多呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"但做著壞事的人即使有著好的想法，又怎麼能被叫做好人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......好像也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"還不如從一開始就承認自己是壞人啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，獄警來了，要開工了，之後在醫務室見吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"你也趕緊走吧，說不定等下這些人又要幹一架了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米娜","speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，卡夫卡，你也小心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_108_silent","aliases":["赫默"]},{"speakerId":"char_214_kafka","aliases":["卡夫卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_242_mayer","aliases":["梅爾"]},{"speakerId":"char_440_Pinecone","aliases":["米娜"]}]}
